WEBVTT

00:01:11.858 --> 00:01:14.860
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> So, your sister is visiting from the US?

00:01:15.460 --> 00:01:17.624
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yeah, she arrived late last night.

00:01:18.403 --> 00:01:20.020
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> Is she staying with you?

00:01:20.571 --> 00:01:22.140
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> No, she’s in a hotel.

00:01:22.702 --> 00:01:24.180
My apartment’s too small.

00:01:24.620 --> 00:01:25.705
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> Oh, OK.

00:01:26.326 --> 00:01:28.040
She’s your twin, right?

00:01:28.609 --> 00:01:29.860
That’s so cool.

00:01:30.660 --> 00:01:33.180
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yeah… she’s going to meet Izzy this evening.

00:01:33.596 --> 00:01:34.455
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> Cool!

00:01:35.656 --> 00:01:36.465
Are you nervous?

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:38.399
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Nervous?

00:01:41.568 --> 00:01:42.180
Why?

00:01:43.454 --> 00:01:44.940
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> I don’t know.

00:01:46.060 --> 00:01:49.980
Your girlfriend is going to meet your family for the first time.

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:54.980
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Well, it’s not all my family, just my sister.

00:01:55.433 --> 00:01:57.260
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> Oh, well, fine.

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:04.320
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yeah, I mean… they’re very different,

00:02:06.099 --> 00:02:08.640
but I’m sure they’re going to get on well.

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:11.260
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> Where are you going to meet?

00:02:11.902 --> 00:02:14.500
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Here, after Izzy finishes work.

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:17.860
Emma’s at the hotel now.

00:02:18.380 --> 00:02:20.620
<v><b>Carla:</b></v> Oh, well, I look forward to meeting her!

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:37.313
<v><b>Max:</b></v> Hey Izzy, come and look at the new design.

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:38.980
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Sure!

00:02:52.979 --> 00:02:56.820
<v><b>Max:</b></v> Listen, Izzy, are you free to go for a drink this evening?

00:02:58.660 --> 00:03:05.620
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Oh, I… um… I’m sorry, I can’t.

00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:08.998
<v><b>Max:</b></v> Oh no, it’s not just me – it’s everybody.

00:03:08.998 --> 00:03:11.720
It’s a good chance to get to know the team.

00:03:12.238 --> 00:03:13.694
<v><b>Ola:</b></v> Yeah, come on, Izzy.

00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:15.176
We always have a great time.

00:03:16.456 --> 00:03:19.027
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Thank you, Ola, but I can’t.

00:03:19.465 --> 00:03:21.424
I’m meeting Ben and his sister this evening.

00:03:22.150 --> 00:03:25.180
<v><b>Ola:</b></v> I think the Managing Director is going to be there.

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:26.580
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v>  Really?

00:03:27.387 --> 00:03:28.942
<v><b>Ola:</b></v> Yeah, have you met him?

00:03:29.702 --> 00:03:30.918
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> No, I haven’t…

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:35.620
Maybe I can come later.

00:03:36.699 --> 00:03:38.867
<v><b>Max:</b></v> Great. We’re meeting at the Red Lion.

00:03:39.142 --> 00:03:40.020
Come when you can.